"ranges with the managed address bits set, and the use SLAAC bit reset. To "
"change this default, select a combination of the possible options here. "
"\"slaac\", \"ra-stateless\" and \"ra-names\" can be freely combined, all "
"other options shall remain single selections."
msgstr ""
"التحكم في كيفية حصول عملاء IPv6 على عناوينهم. تفعيل إعلانات الموجّه في "
