"expected to last on server side and it is expected to be closed afterwards. "
"If you enter 0, it is expected, that the server never responds to a "
"datagram. If nginx gets a datagram, it will still get forwarded to the "
"client. Setting this option might be useful in (mostly) unidirectional "
"communication as well."
msgstr ""
